    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431320/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1688460317\" /></span><br><br>In a peaceful rhythmic city run by music beats, lives a cat who is fed up with his owner constantly annoying him, and decides to run away from home, starting a revolution to take over the city. Vexa, desperate to hold Catuccino again, decides to follow him and get him back. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431320/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1688460317\" /></span><br>Traverse the beautiful city while you interact with it! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431320/extras/947a9c76b0aac06dedd2f445cef7b388.poster.avif?t=1688460317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431320/extras/947a9c76b0aac06dedd2f445cef7b388.webm?t=1688460317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431320/extras/947a9c76b0aac06dedd2f445cef7b388.mp4?t=1688460317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get Catuccino back! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431320/extras/1cb6b0b15c3ca0462dfa1963578a0b28.poster.avif?t=1688460317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431320/extras/1cb6b0b15c3ca0462dfa1963578a0b28.webm?t=1688460317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431320/extras/1cb6b0b15c3ca0462dfa1963578a0b28.mp4?t=1688460317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid